WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
AbrisCraft: a 3D garden shed configurator. The width, length and wall height sliders resize the shed, and the material list recounts its parts.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Style tab: the roof type, gable or single pitch, then a double door instead of a single one.

00:12.000 --> 00:19.000
Options tab: four windows, then gutters; the list gains the openings and the drainage parts.

00:19.000 --> 00:22.000
The exploded view pulls the floor, walls, roof and door apart.

00:22.000 --> 00:25.000
Hardware tab: screws, nails, brackets and door fittings, each with its quantity.

00:25.000 --> 00:28.000
A 3.5 × 45 mm wood screw opens on its product sheet: diameter, length, head, material and weight.

00:28.000 --> 00:31.560
The shed assembles again and the camera moves in close on the roof and the door.
